<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:blogger='http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008' xmlns:georss='http://www.georss.org/georss' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005" xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0'><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159</id><updated>2025-08-05T00:35:19.589-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Rosa negra</title><subtitle type='html'></subtitle><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/posts/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default?redirect=false'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/'/><link rel='hub' href='http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/'/><link rel='next' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default?start-index=26&amp;max-results=25&amp;redirect=false'/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>831</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-7634250261615232512</id><published>2022-12-23T12:14:00.007-08:00</published><updated>2022-12-23T12:14:43.819-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;13/12/2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;D&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;e sobra sabes que eres la primera, y sabes que daría por ti la vida entera, y sin embargo un rato te cambiarîa por cualquiera,  te engañarîa con cualquiera..así canta feliz mi canalla favorito, visto desde la desfachatez de un don Juan bien mujeriego, aunque el paso del tiempo ha hecho mella en su estampa , resta intacta su sutil y privilegiada expresión, un poco cínica y cautivadora, el de Ûbeda que me enamoró a mis 20 años con su princesa, sigue dando guerra, pero es que &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #050505; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;puede permitîrselo, se ha ganado el territorio, todo viene a cuento de ciertas personas que pululan cono mariposas sin tomar polen ni hacer miel, con un puñado de palabras que van esparciendo sin conciencia y sin mucha consciencia, escudàndose en no sé que cuento, de estas enfermedades nuevas que no dejan de aparecer y multiplicarse, de las que hace poco más de 40 años , te decían en el seno de tu familia bien estructurada =÷&quot;o te espabilas o te doy un sopapo para que lo hagas&quot;, y no nos quedaba otro remedio que superar adicciones, anorexias, tentaciones., así nos curtîan para la vida, con un montón de hermanos, no había regalos, ni caprichos ni clemencia, y aprendías a comer lo que había, a heredar la ropa y los zapatos, a irte al internado de turno sin rechistar, e ibas perdiendo progresivamente las angustias y los miedos. Pues bien después de este aprendizaje no se pueden aguantar algunas conductas, porque para quien eres , yo bien me valgo,  y perder el tiempo no está de moda, vale tanto como saber elegir, y si como veo, prefieres otra gente más divertida y capaz, pues yo también,  pero a ser posible, en vivo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;La lealtad me rige y me dirige, mi consciencia me dice que es hora de salir de salmos y versîculos,  de una comunicación de besugos que no me aporta nada , para que sueñes con todas y conmigo, sin olvidar que soy la primera, yo no sé si entre la niña, la Sanvenancio,  Nela ....podré , porque saber elegir es aprender a vivir, y como sabes bien , nací para ser y no para obedecer.  Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/7634250261615232512/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/13122022-d-e-sobra-sabes-que-eres-la.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/7634250261615232512'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/7634250261615232512'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/13122022-d-e-sobra-sabes-que-eres-la.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-7526175295727291096</id><published>2022-12-23T12:12:00.004-08:00</published><updated>2022-12-23T12:12:24.976-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;13/12/2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xdj266r x126k92a&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;HAY HOMBRES SIN CUERPO Y SIN SANGRE &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Y si piensas qué no te amo, te equivocas!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Tú eres mi norte y mi sur, brújula rota.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Espero con ansia tu mirada, tus palabras, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt; tus &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;manos dibujando caricias en mi piel mientras me cantas con voz recia y profunda, salida de la tormenta que te azota,  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;tu cuerpo es la mitad del mío, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;y todo tú, la parte que me falta, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;que rige mis latidos, y mis miedos espantas.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Ay corazón nacido en los albores de un septiembre avanzado, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;cuando se precipitan los más bellos ocasos,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt; y es más intensa la luz del mediodía,  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;yo me pregunto amor qué hubiera sido escribir,  guiada por tu mano, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;peinada por tus dedos, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;hendida por tu abrazo.  Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/7526175295727291096/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/13122022-hay-hombres-sin-cuerpo-y-sin.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/7526175295727291096'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/7526175295727291096'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/13122022-hay-hombres-sin-cuerpo-y-sin.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-610241399672672836</id><published>2022-12-23T12:00:00.006-08:00</published><updated>2022-12-23T12:00:37.488-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Oscura es la noche del mundo sin ti ,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; a penas se presiente la forma de tu rostro,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;  la sombra de tu voz,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;  el dulce calor  divino de tu origen,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; me gusta el nuevo idioma de versos y de besos,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; que &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;mata los silencios sombríos, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; las subidas dolorosas con los pies descalzos.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;  las penas inventadas que amargan-&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Quiero volar contigo en la magia del sueño,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; donde habitan las hadas en un jardín de orquídeas,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; mariposas y colibríes, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; ternura en esos párpados hechos a la belleza , &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;  caricia de pétalos de rosas,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;  abrazo de los cuerpos rodando por el suelo. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;  amor, vida, deseo.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;    Mara G 19/12/2022&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/610241399672672836/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/oscura-es-la-noche-del-mundo-sin-ti.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/610241399672672836'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/610241399672672836'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/oscura-es-la-noche-del-mundo-sin-ti.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-5605060470500625627</id><published>2022-12-23T11:16:00.003-08:00</published><updated>2022-12-23T11:16:54.881-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hace unas horas&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;No buscamos amor,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; buscamos ser queridos y querer,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; como un gran lazo, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; a veces, el amor nos atrapa ,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; sin renglones, sin piedad y sin prisas, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; nos vuelve más torpes, más sensibles, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; hasta un poco más débiles, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; pero es que el corazón no entiende de reglas ni mandatos, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;él llega y se hace un sitio,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; sin preguntar siquiera.  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y las noches son una larga espera &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;si no lo tienes cerca, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; un silencio de luna hecha de escarcha, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;un barco en la galerna,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; una idea viajando a ciegas, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;sin brújula o mejor, con una desimantada, vieja, que confunde el norte con el sur,  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;y las horas no pasan,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; el desvelo comienza. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Llega el amanecer,  el sol, la luz y la consciencia.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Estamos tan solos,  tan azules,  tan fríos,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;  que nos duele la ausencia &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;y nos quema el olvido, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;y por esa razón yo te quiero conmigo.  Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/5605060470500625627/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/unas-horas-no-buscamos-amor-buscamos.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/5605060470500625627'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/5605060470500625627'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/unas-horas-no-buscamos-amor-buscamos.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-5060541884084889517</id><published>2022-12-23T11:15:00.000-08:00</published><updated>2022-12-23T11:15:35.701-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y yo tan esquemática, tan aparentemente cerebral,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;aquí me tienes, desnuda y despeinada,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;perdiendo los papeles, riendo o llorando como&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;la niña que fui,o la mujer que hoy soy.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Aquí me tienes, en uno de los días finales de otro diciembre,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;arropada por los míos qué, aunque tiemblan de frío,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;se permiten el lujo de poder dar calor,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y es que al cabo del tiempo entiendes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;que hay corazones llenos, y vacíos, sin fondo,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;a los primeros les sobra la alegría y el humor,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;la gracia al compartir sus posesiones,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;a los segundos, aunque tuvieran el mundo,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;no darían ni siquiera la palabra de ánimo,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;la llave de la confianza, el misterio del abrazo...&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Aquí estoy llena de color, rebosante de vida,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;aquí donde todo es sencillo y duele menos.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;aquí donde nadie controla el amor, pero  como la rosa,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;el amor es capaz de dominar todas las cosas.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/5060541884084889517/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/y-yo-tan-esquematica-tan-aparentemente.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/5060541884084889517'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/5060541884084889517'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/y-yo-tan-esquematica-tan-aparentemente.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-8291415666092171561</id><published>2022-12-23T11:12:00.002-08:00</published><updated>2022-12-23T11:12:24.079-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;INSOMNE 22/12/2022 TRAS LA CENA DE LA ESCUELA DE PINTURA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;No puedo dormir,  no estoy acostumbrada a los excesos en la comida, si bien he tomado la mitad y una esquina de pan. No dejo de acordarme de mi padre, si me hubiera visto con el pelo ondulado, y mis manos sin un bolígrafo haciendo números,  lo que a los dos más nos gustaba, ...supongo que me habría dicho ÷!qué bonita estás Merceditas!, el único que me ha llamado así,  a la llegada a casa me lo ha dicho mi niño mayor,me ha hecho fotos,  y me ha dado  un par de besos,  también &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;le recuerdo llamándome madraza, y  es que todo no es lo que parece,  el recuerdo viene de la mano del dolor, aunque es más elegante mostrar la cara dulce que la amarga, en un adiós estamos  y su fortaleza es un ejemplo ante todos,  y ella,  seguro, no hubiera aprobado mis tacones. Es la vida y su paso, lo que somos y cómo,  y mis complejos  desde qué tenía un par de años, y me llevó a un velatorio, me cuenta que  al ver a la gente llorar,  le pregunté ÷= mama,  yo la más fea de todas ?. Os explico,  era la cuarta niña, y una vecina del pueblo quería mucho a la tercera de mis hermanas y amargó mi niñez.  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Ahora, cuando ha pasado el tiempo,  y han caducado los plazos de complejos impuestos a un interés fijo, ahora puedo reírme de los kilos de más,  y de la escasez de pelo, de una desproporción entre aspecto y concepto,  ahora  he visto que somos un todo y que hay que cuidarlo, porque ser brillante no basta, ser buena tampoco , ser bella  es tener la armonía de la rosa, delicados Colores,  geometría perfecta, y un perfume de estrella. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G  insomne&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/8291415666092171561/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/22122022-tras-la-cena-de-la-escuela-de.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/8291415666092171561'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/8291415666092171561'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/22122022-tras-la-cena-de-la-escuela-de.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-1207948299194932244</id><published>2022-12-23T11:09:00.000-08:00</published><updated>2022-12-23T11:09:22.807-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Estoy pensando en la gente que está enferma y sola, en aquella que no tiene un lugar para vivir,  o un plato de comida caliente, en los que abren los ojos en la mañana sin saber como resolver sus necesidades más urgentes.  Y también pienso en los otros,  ésos que, teniendo lo necesario,  no es feliz,  y se debate en un charco de amargura por enfermedad, problemas en las relaciones humanas etc. Y finalmente estamos los gaitas, los que sin ninguna dificultad aparente, nos &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;movemos en el mundo de querer no sé qué,  qué hay que buscar no sé dónde,  sin saber muy bien para qué,  y en el bucle se nos va el tiempo.  En fin,  es la pluralidad.  A todos vosotros os deseo lo mejor y a cada uno lo que necesitéis.  Intentad  ser felices. Suerte en la lotería,  poneos guapos y celebrar la vida. Mara G&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/1207948299194932244/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/estoy-pensando-en-la-gente-que-esta.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/1207948299194932244'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/1207948299194932244'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/12/estoy-pensando-en-la-gente-que-esta.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-3320148084374608112</id><published>2022-11-06T06:02:00.002-08:00</published><updated>2022-11-06T06:02:34.681-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Y HAY DESTINOS ,,,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Hay destinos con flores, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Con puestas de sol y con naranjas,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Con olor a manzanas y membrillos,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Con gente que te abraza como hiedra, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Con corazón   alegre .y suave de amapola,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Genre que es acogedora como ese rinconcito&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;De un salón con chimenea,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; las manos enlazadas contando historias al amor de la lumbre .&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/3320148084374608112/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/hay-destinos-hay-destinos-con-flores.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/3320148084374608112'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/3320148084374608112'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/hay-destinos-hay-destinos-con-flores.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-1427726133516428593</id><published>2022-11-06T05:57:00.001-08:00</published><updated>2022-11-06T05:57:17.006-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Cuando alguien de verdad entra en tu vida,  es raro que salga de ella,  porque nacimos entre esa gente, y entre ella crecimos. Y luego,  ya de grandes,  llegaron los amores, los amigos y se fueron añadiendo como una capa más de una cebolla, crecemos pero en el fondo somos lo que y los que fuimos.  Mara G&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;En el adiós tan triste estamos, verte tan frágil a ti, mujer de mil batallas, en  ese silencio de miradas perdidas, no sé hacia donde, o ver tus ojos vidriosos en el borde del llanto, a veces te quejas,  te debe doler todo, tanto que nos contestas ÷_no sé lo que me duele,  supongo que te preocupa , no tanto el irte sino saber que nos dejas, y éso es el mayor de los esfuerzos para una madre. Siempre has sido tan intuitiva y tan serena!, nos has mostrado el camino y sus &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;dificultades,  mujer valiente, madre, no queremos que sufras, en tu consciente deterioro, en esta despedida, abrazo de los primeros brazos, intenso abrazo. Mara G&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/1427726133516428593/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/cuando-alguien-de-verdad-entra-en-tu.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/1427726133516428593'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/1427726133516428593'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/cuando-alguien-de-verdad-entra-en-tu.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-8709858990631554061</id><published>2022-11-06T05:53:00.002-08:00</published><updated>2022-11-06T05:53:23.701-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Si alguien supiera como mi corazón tiembla,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Si en verdad supieran la realidad que me rodea&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Si la noche llegara vacía , sin ti y sin estrellas &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Si se rompe el dolor, si llegara el adiós &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Si los sueños despiertan&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Y me asomo a la vida&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Me asomo porque me encanta ver lo que pasa fuera de mî, en los trópicos, donde la vida nace y muere en una contraposición predicha, dîa y noche, vigilia y sueño, alegría y tristeza.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;La vida joven, despierta,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;La vida vieja, se agota,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;La &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;vida que ama, rîe,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;La esperanza no está rota.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/8709858990631554061/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/si-alguien-supiera-como-mi-corazon.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/8709858990631554061'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/8709858990631554061'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/si-alguien-supiera-como-mi-corazon.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-345067762574293109</id><published>2022-11-06T05:48:00.002-08:00</published><updated>2022-11-06T05:48:35.391-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Tantas veces pensé , al principio, en no guardarte, pero a la par de complicado me pareciste sumamente interesante, y fui dando puntadas con paciencia, teniendo cuidado en no romper el hilo ni pincharnos, tal vez porque tu vida no es fácil, tampoco la mía y para cuadrar las telas, tengamos que hacer virguerías,para lograr una armonía entre la risa y el llanto, la fantasía y la realidad, la compañía y la ausencia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;He salido a buscarte como cada mañana, echaba en falta tu olor y &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;tu risa, tu amor y tu infantil insensatez, también la mía.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;He salido a encontrarte como siempre hago, paraguas y corazón en las manos, inquietud y deseo a partes iguales.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;He salido a por ti, porque desde hace tiempo sé que somos cara y cruz de la moneda, un todo triste y divertido.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;No podrán con nosotros el huracán furioso, el mar en la galerna, el sofoco del sol en el desierto, ...las bocas envidiosas. Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/345067762574293109/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/tantas-veces-pense-al-principio-en-no.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/345067762574293109'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/345067762574293109'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/tantas-veces-pense-al-principio-en-no.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-926010887402505537</id><published>2022-11-06T05:46:00.001-08:00</published><updated>2022-11-06T05:46:06.913-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y tú recuerdo vuela hoy como las mariposas blancas en torno a la luz de la lámpara,  incluso alguna se atreve a posarse sobre el renglón de la página escogida de un libro de Cernuda, y me gustaría pensar, mejor aún,  quiero creer que eres feliz, que tu alma niña anda volando dichosa, porque cuando te quieren de verdad, lo que desean es verte bailar, verte reîr, verte disfrutar, verte vivir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Yo hubiera querido volar al lado tuyo,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Llegar hasta Venecia de tu mano,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Yo hubiera &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;querido leer para ti Rayuela,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y ser tu Maga.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Yo también hubiera querido ser tu niña mujer,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y hacerte comprender el lado humano,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;La sombra de los besos,  el delirio soñado.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Yo hubiera querido despertarte, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Tû no eres quien te han dicho, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;eres un ser lleno de amor, inteligente y tierno,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;  y a este punto llegado, solo puedo decirte vive, siente ,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; sé tú, demuestra lo que vales!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/926010887402505537/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/y-tu-recuerdo-vuela-hoy-como-las.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/926010887402505537'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/926010887402505537'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/y-tu-recuerdo-vuela-hoy-como-las.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-2033505823911141543</id><published>2022-11-06T05:42:00.002-08:00</published><updated>2022-11-06T05:42:55.783-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;DORMIR Y DESPERTAR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Porque llegué después,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;yo no soy menos, tampoco más, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;solo soy otra, diferente.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Soy alegre y vital&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;como &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;un pajarillo en primavera,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;como un sol que amanece radiante,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;completamente nuevo,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;yo solo soy como el niño que tiembla&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;anhelando unos brazos.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Yo respeto a la gente que nació sin nada&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;y tuvo que luchar desde chico,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;respeto a los valientes que enfrentan la vida,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;y a los muertos que duermen ya para siempre.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Los vivos despertamos tras el sueño y los sueños,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;a veces con la pena de haber perdido a los seres queridos,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Pero la lucha y la fatiga siguen,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;como sigue el placer y la risa,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;contradicción continua de versos arrastrados, vida. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/2033505823911141543/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/dormir-y-despertar-porque-llegue.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/2033505823911141543'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/2033505823911141543'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/dormir-y-despertar-porque-llegue.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-5922794367727198244</id><published>2022-11-06T05:35:00.001-08:00</published><updated>2022-11-06T05:35:47.075-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y media sonrisa se dibuja en mi rostro cuando  me discuten sobre mi edad, y la otra  se borra cuando quieren hablar conmigo,  y pregunto por un tema, actualidad, arte, literatura,  ...?, y no hay más que  una absurda cuestión de indagar sobre sensaciones que no se escriben sino que se viven. El ser humano se esconde tras una pantalla para no vivir lo que no se atreve, para no estar tan bien no juntos,  estás leyendo bien, así se escribe la no realidad virtual,  donde los no &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #050505; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;te amo,  disminuyen la falsedad y no somos no tan culpables.  En mi estudio psicosocial he aprendido muchas cosas dignas de usar un tiempo para rehacer conciencias , un lenguaje extraordinariamente confuso,  una no verdad, un medio deseo, una semidentidad, y ese secreto de ser todos famosos, artistas, maravillosos. Y ahora lo màs fuerte , escrito textualmente ÷-me gusta la gente débil,  y en aquel instante pensé÷-Dios mío,  para qué?...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Aquí sî hay debate,  no es solo un paliativo de soledad, traumas o angustia,  algo está enfermo y me duele.  Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;placeholder&quot; height=&quot;240&quot; id=&quot;a9f2dda7fddc1&quot; src=&quot;https://www.blogger.com/img/transparent.gif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #d8d8d8; background-image: url(&#39;https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/materialiconsextended/insert_photo/v6/grey600-24dp/1x/baseline_insert_photo_grey600_24dp.png&#39;); background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; opacity: 0.6;&quot; width=&quot;320&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/5922794367727198244/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/y-media-sonrisa-se-dibuja-en-mi-rostro.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/5922794367727198244'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/5922794367727198244'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/y-media-sonrisa-se-dibuja-en-mi-rostro.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-948654686605791196</id><published>2022-11-06T05:31:00.002-08:00</published><updated>2022-11-06T05:31:58.156-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y esa huella furtiva de tus pies en la mojada arena de la playa,  pasó tres veces su lengua el mar y la borró con rapidez, pensaba en mi cabeza y en tu idea, beso de sol a la nube de agua, y ahí permaneces lazo que enreda y adorna mi neurona, la amatoria y vital,  llegaste sin avisar,  sin ruido, y sin permiso, entraste como luz por mi ventana, mariposa de sueños,  y te quedaste hasta que llegó el frío,  y nuevamente,  en silencio, levantaste tu vuelo,  porque un ser como tú &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #050505; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;no pesa nunca, solo se  hace querer en un arrullo frágil, en un murmullo  de fragancias,  en el adiós del sol o en su saludo,  aquí me quedo yo, y aquí tienes tu sitio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;No sé acaba el amor por un adiós, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Porque el adiós no existe, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;es un velo entre presencia y ausencia, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Una brisa tenue entre mirada y beso.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;El amor, ese deseo eternamente insatisfecho de Cernuda, no deja de crecer una vez nace, y quiere , en todo instante, sucumbir al abrazo,  romperse como ola , quemarse como llama, y recogerse más nuevo , màs lleno de fuerza e ilusión,  más  pleno y vivo.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Porque el amor no muere en el adiós,  tampoco se puede apagar su llama como si de fuego se tratara.  Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/948654686605791196/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/y-esa-huella-furtiva-de-tus-pies-en-la.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/948654686605791196'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/948654686605791196'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/y-esa-huella-furtiva-de-tus-pies-en-la.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-846009805547496922</id><published>2022-11-06T05:28:00.002-08:00</published><updated>2022-11-06T05:28:32.405-08:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;NO SABEMOS LA RAZÓN DEL AMOR, SI ES QUE LA TIENE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Por ti y sin yo saberlo,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;He mirado con otros ojos,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt; la magia de la tierra, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;sus &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;flores y sus frutos,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Sus inmensas praderas y sus bosques frondosos.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;El cielo despejado, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;las traviesas nubes,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt; el sol encendido, el sol apagado&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt; la luna en una noche oscura.,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Por ti he soñado con rosas de imposibles colores,  con pájaros azules, con peces leonados y lagartos sin cola, bailando una balada de las que a ti te gustan.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Por ti me he disfrazado de Ali en Love Story, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;de joven, casi niña, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;me he sentido importante y mayor,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Como repasando el cuento de mi vida,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Los días plenos, los llenos de luz y de alegría, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Los otros tristes, de soledad, de pérdida y de angustia,  y tú,  poniendo luces de colores., subido a lomos de un caballito del tîovivo.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Qué somos sino amor, llantos y risas?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Felicidad desperezada en tramos de la vida!!!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/846009805547496922/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/no-sabemos-la-razon-del-amor-si-es-que.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/846009805547496922'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/846009805547496922'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/11/no-sabemos-la-razon-del-amor-si-es-que.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-497825896551106308</id><published>2022-10-08T03:27:00.001-07:00</published><updated>2022-10-08T03:27:29.231-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEgY9gkL5efiQ3HQ6FsIkbvC6vFYWSFsRdJmlXtFfr42ToMq7DGGXm8YS0ByHIyd16fih-777Vxtg_u4qa3ovlcHXL4tfOkVunHu4zGRb7tJhFEsu0DyjFHZvDAG9tWQuwQnHT2NbeLZts8DX2TFAoIcKaD1eyEr-YieJVApugM3GllzSL1e0cGcz_Gw&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; data-original-height=&quot;960&quot; data-original-width=&quot;960&quot; height=&quot;415&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEgY9gkL5efiQ3HQ6FsIkbvC6vFYWSFsRdJmlXtFfr42ToMq7DGGXm8YS0ByHIyd16fih-777Vxtg_u4qa3ovlcHXL4tfOkVunHu4zGRb7tJhFEsu0DyjFHZvDAG9tWQuwQnHT2NbeLZts8DX2TFAoIcKaD1eyEr-YieJVApugM3GllzSL1e0cGcz_Gw=w415-h415&quot; width=&quot;415&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&amp;nbsp;LO QUE DE TI PROCEDE. CURA&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lo que parte de ti ,es un bálsamo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;para la piel quemada por los años,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;para las arrugas del alma,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;para la voz rota en la garganta,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;para las manos desolladas laborando,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;para un ajado corazón de porcelana.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Porque en este tiempo de lluvias,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;frías nieves y calores,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;hemos ido aprendiendo ,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;primero a conocernos,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;segundo a respetarnos,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;tercero a sostenernos,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;y así hasta diez,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;el décimo es querernos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lo que de ti procede, cura.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mara G&lt;/p&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/497825896551106308/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/10/que-de-ti-procede.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/497825896551106308'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/497825896551106308'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/10/que-de-ti-procede.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEgY9gkL5efiQ3HQ6FsIkbvC6vFYWSFsRdJmlXtFfr42ToMq7DGGXm8YS0ByHIyd16fih-777Vxtg_u4qa3ovlcHXL4tfOkVunHu4zGRb7tJhFEsu0DyjFHZvDAG9tWQuwQnHT2NbeLZts8DX2TFAoIcKaD1eyEr-YieJVApugM3GllzSL1e0cGcz_Gw=s72-w415-h415-c" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-469325646563612385</id><published>2022-09-23T10:26:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2022-09-23T10:26:03.417-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;GRACIAS &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Cuando cierro los ojos , yo te amo,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;También cuando los abro,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;O lloro o te sonrîo o te recuerdo,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Como un río de sueño y de memoria, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Nadie ha estado nunca,  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;tan atento à mi cauce y a mis orillas, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;y es una de las razones que me hacen quererte, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; esperarte con ansia como al sol y la lluvia, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; florecer de nuevo entre las intrincadas ramas del cedro, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;los juncos, la corriente,y  sus abrazos &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;jardinero mío,  florecer para ti, mi jardinero. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/469325646563612385/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/09/gracias-cuando-cierro-los-ojos-yo-te.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/469325646563612385'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/469325646563612385'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/09/gracias-cuando-cierro-los-ojos-yo-te.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-4750364523233418089</id><published>2022-09-23T10:13:00.001-07:00</published><updated>2022-09-23T10:13:09.225-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Quiero ir sembrando en los surcos de la memoria, lo que parte de mi yo y llega hasta mis dedos, y en esa trayectoria en ocasiones recta, otras con cerradas curvas, a veces con pendientes de vértigo de espirales profundas,ser trigo, pino u olivo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Quiero estar llena como la tierra bien cultivada, verde, fresca y brillante, o llena de colores y sabores, o de los olores dulces de la fruta madura. Pero en algunos momentos, necesito vaciarme y ser nada, nadie, sólo yo y unas manos, &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;sólo yo y una boca, sólo yo y unos ojos, sólo yo y un  cuerpo.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; Quiero llevar mis manos abiertas, llenas y paralelas, la mirada serena o la anegada por las lágrimas,la sonrisa en la boca ...siempre tendré mis pies que me sujeten a la tierra que rotura el arado,besana recta y firme de labrador experto. Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Yo no te quiero màs grande amor,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;ni tampoco màs serio o diferente, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;te quiero con tus risas y manías,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt; con tu mordacidad y tus rutinas&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Hay días en que desearía  arremeter contra el mundo, en esta soledad de molinos de viento, y como ellos giro en un abrazo vacío y loco. En otras ocasiones pienso que no es la mejor forma  de enfrentarse a la vida, querer que despertarse cueste menos, y caminar no canse, y las caídas sean menos dolorosas, más amables,  tan llenas de ilusión que nos desborden. Hay otros momentos en qué yo rodarìa hasta tu encuentro,  sin vergüenza,  entre risas, sin pensar en que se mancha o se &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;rompe el vestido, mostrando un poco el desastre que somos cuando ha pasado el tiempo por nosotros,  y sin enterarnos, hemos ido perdiendo una batalla,  pero no perderemos esta guerra.  Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/4750364523233418089/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/09/quiero-ir-sembrando-en-los-surcos-de-la.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/4750364523233418089'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/4750364523233418089'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/09/quiero-ir-sembrando-en-los-surcos-de-la.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-1790548976770249512</id><published>2022-09-23T10:07:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2022-09-23T10:07:37.469-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Tu edad no me asusta,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Me da miedo el viento de la angustia,  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Con su misterio oscuro  que te sobrevuela, &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Esa carga pesada que detiene tu mano,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Pero tienes mis &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;manos,  y mi alma viva. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Para poder volar en este tiempo. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Si quieres volar en el cielo, necesitas salir de la Tierra. Si desea avanzar, tienes que dejar ir el pasado, porque si algo no está en nuestra vida, es porque ; a) No supimos cuidarlo, b) Porque no estábamos preparados, o bien nos apretó o nos quedó grande, pero no era nuestra talla,c) En toda relación hay cosas buenas, y las menos buenas las suaviza el recuerdo capaz de borrar las aristas del dolor, pero si algo termina por causas no naturales, hemos de analizar forma, fondo &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;y partes interesadas, aceptarlo y dejar ir. Se vive el presente, hay personas maravillosas, aunque no tengan la juventud, belleza, y dones , seguro que merecen la pena.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Recuérdame memoria lo feliz que he sido, pero no ciegues lo que hoy tengo y quiero disfrutar, porque&quot; si no te conozco, no he vivido Cernuda&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Serà qué la lluvia se apodera de las melancolías?; y es que un beso de lluvia lava las heridas pero un beso de sol, las sana.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;Tantas veces te pensé,  tantas veces te soñara! Que en mi delirio te vi aparecer con una rosa, y una risa, y me abrazabas. Mara G&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/1790548976770249512/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/09/tu-edad-no-me-asusta-me-da-miedo-el.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/1790548976770249512'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/1790548976770249512'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/09/tu-edad-no-me-asusta-me-da-miedo-el.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-2529701559898200028</id><published>2022-08-30T17:02:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2022-08-30T17:02:04.288-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y seguiràs buscando a ciegas,  con la desesperaciôn de un náufrago su isla, en cuatro renglones mal escritos de un erotismo desvirtuado y sin más fundamento que esta terrible soledad que nos embarga  hoy, en pleno siglos  XXI , con toda libertad y comunicación fàcil,  se va sustituyendo el amor de toda la vida, del abrazo y el beso, la pasión y el deseo, por otro sin maraña de un cuerpo, platónico el amor y el sexo tántrico, cibersexo, lo llaman, se ofrece sin recato,  sin &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #050505; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;conocerte,  como la panacea de un placer limpio,  barato y sin complicaciones, pues bien,  yo respeto a esa maravillosa gente que se conforma así. pero yo no lo quiero, un amor sin sentirlo à flor de piel, sin la càlida magia de los sentidos consentidos y os explico por qué ÷_sentidos equivale a sentir dos,  algo capaz de elevar a  lo más alto y caer hasta el abismo, amar cuando se ama es el mejor de los regalos , y queda claro que no es fácil conocer, saltar la chispa, conectar,  conseguir la armonía,  todos estos preámbulos son la antesala de la felicidad. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mi vida sin ti es mi vida sin mí.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/2529701559898200028/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/y-seguiras-buscando-ciegas-con-la.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/2529701559898200028'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/2529701559898200028'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/y-seguiras-buscando-ciegas-con-la.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-5571308526914276490</id><published>2022-08-30T17:00:00.002-07:00</published><updated>2022-08-30T17:00:45.975-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;UNO SE ACOSTUMBRA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;, por Mara Guadalix&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;Se acostumbra a ver una sombra a su lado,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;Se acostumbra a una voz que a duras penas dice nada,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;Se acostumbra a unos pasos cansinos, arrastrados&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;Se acostumbra a una sonrisa hueca y lejana&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;Se acostumbra a unos ojos sin brillo, como noche cerrada&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;Se acostumbra a dar explicaciones de sus actos a quien anda por ahí vegetando,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;y sobrevivimos juntos a la miseria que queda de aquel amor que hubo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;Uno se acostumbra a no ser,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;a no dar ese paseo por el río o la plaza,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;a no tomar sus vinos con los amigos,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;ésos&amp;nbsp; que quedan,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;y piensas en los que de a poco han ido cayendo,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;piensas también en no hacer ese viaje soñado&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Uno se acostumbra a no vivir,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;porque así de jodidamente cobardes somos,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;y adaptarse no es tan bueno,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;background-color: #fff9ee; color: #222222; font-family: Georgia, Utopia, &amp;quot;Palatino Linotype&amp;quot;, Palatino, serif; font-size: 15.4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: georgia;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;sobrevivir no es vivir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/5571308526914276490/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/uno-se-acostumbra-por-mara-guadalix-se.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/5571308526914276490'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/5571308526914276490'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/uno-se-acostumbra-por-mara-guadalix-se.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-3341696379654832953</id><published>2022-08-30T16:58:00.002-07:00</published><updated>2022-08-30T16:58:56.756-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Ya está aquí la tormenta ha llegado de la mano de un bochorno inaguantable, con el ruido clamoroso de un grupo de percusión,  poco después acompañados del alboroto de grandes goterones cayendo rápidos y furiosos contra el tragaluz, vendrá muy bien para limpiar la atmósfera y saciar la tierra de la sed que arrastra tras meses de sequía , algo hará como una bendiciôn divina. Y en este estruendo giran mis alocados pensamientos ,  y me duelen en sus choques,  porque la realidad &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #050505; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;no se presenta halagůeña y tiene poco que ver con lo soñado, qué cruel es querer y no poder.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/3341696379654832953/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/ya-esta-aqui-la-tormenta-ha-llegado-de.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/3341696379654832953'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/3341696379654832953'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/ya-esta-aqui-la-tormenta-ha-llegado-de.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-6823099289449394279</id><published>2022-08-30T16:57:00.002-07:00</published><updated>2022-08-30T16:57:20.256-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Es tan corto el amor y es tan largo el olvido...escribió acertadamente Neruda,  es un capricho del corazón,  entre miles de personas se empeña en ver a una más cercana, inteligente, atractiva,  especial, simpática, única  y la cabeza trabaja para crear un mundo feliz donde no cabe una opinión ajena que pueda contrariarnos,  y seríamos capaces de dejarlo todo e ir tras la aventura,  si algo se tuerce, sufres , aûn cuando sepas que es inseguro e incierto. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Subí a la montaña para &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;encontrarte, y solo encontré ese humo gris y huidizo de las nubes al formarse, y no te vi, y lloré, bajé llorando,  por no poder tenerte, no llevé una botella con corcho para encerrar el espíritu de la nube que habitabas. Me sentí mal, al saber que algo se  moría dentro, y  la risa se esfumó como el sol , erra tarde, era triste, era ausencia, era lágrima y grito, era silencio...y el cansancio me llevó al sueño, y dormí,  y duermo, porque el sueño es la anestesia  del frío olvido. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/6823099289449394279/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/es-tan-corto-el-amor-y-es-tan-largo-el.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/6823099289449394279'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/6823099289449394279'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/es-tan-corto-el-amor-y-es-tan-largo-el.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5988492047534887159.post-3979292083313577796</id><published>2022-08-30T16:53:00.002-07:00</published><updated>2022-08-30T16:53:42.585-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y si la noche hoy no llegara tan hermosa?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Y si la luna y las estrellas fueran de papel mate? Y si tus ojos y los míos no brillaran a ciel abierto?;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Tantas veces te espéré, tantas noches te soñara¡ &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Siempre  creí en ti, hasta en algún momento de rabia por no poder extender la alfombra verde de la esperanza,  y en la manera de decirme= confîa en mi,  confía, , y aunque ahora estemos lejos,  y duelan los silencios, hay algo en ti y en mí que ruge poderoso,  tú sabes que yo no pido  &lt;span style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; transition-property: none !important;&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;mucho, a duras penas  una pequeña cosa, yo necesito tu voz y tus palabras ,  tu mirada, tu risa,  tu caminar sin prisas,  tu mente ágil, tu ser   más impulsivo,  ....dime por qué ? Por qué no abres tus alas ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;animation-name: none !important; background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI Historic&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; transition-property: none !important; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Mara G&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/feeds/3979292083313577796/comments/default' title='Enviar comentarios'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/y-si-la-noche-hoy-no-llegara-tan.html#comment-form' title='0 comentarios'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/3979292083313577796'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/5988492047534887159/posts/default/3979292083313577796'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://mara-rosanegra.blogspot.com/2022/08/y-si-la-noche-hoy-no-llegara-tan.html' title=''/><author><name>Mara Guadalix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02239854475948462231</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry></feed>